# Fixture Lock Protocol (S15)

When the user asks to pull / diagnose a friend’s Bro Code report from GitHub Issues:

1. Resolve target: explicit `#N` → else agent name + latest → else latest `aur-bhai-report`. If ambiguous, stop and ask.
2. Run `dart run tool/fetch_issue_fixture.dart` with `--issue N` or `--agent Name --latest` (needs `CIRCLE_OWNER`, `gh` auth).
3. Print the tool’s lock banner (`Locked fixture: Issue #N | … | path=…`).
4. Work only on that path until the user switches issue.
5. To run on this machine: `dart run tool/install_issue_fixture.dart --path <locked>` then `flutter run` (registers `Friend_<Name>` at C4).
6. After a fix: comment on the Issue + set label `fixed-in-build` or `need-more-info`; ask the friend to try again.
